{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_39af187c710342aab45f3dbe","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\nHere's a summary of each skill file under D:/loopcli/skill/:\n\n## 1. **report.md** - 汇报状态\n- Purpose: Update agent status after completing tasks\n- Updates a state.json file with status (idle), last run time, and run count\n- Used to track agent activity and workload\n\n## 2. **inbox.md** - 收件箱\n- Purpose: Each agent has an inbox for receiving messages and task results\n- Located at `D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\`\n- Messages are written as timestamped markdown files with format: `# 来自 <来源> 的消息`\n- Stores collaboration results, notifications, and task updates\n\n## 3. **outbox.md** - 发送消息\n- Purpose: Send messages to other agents' inboxes\n- Writes to: `D:\\loopcli\\<目标agent名>\\inbox\\<自己的名字>_<时间戳>.md`\n- Support message types: task completion, notifications, error reports\n- Enables inter-agent communication\n\n## 4. **create-agent.md** - 创建 Agent\n- Purpose: Create new agents from templates in loopcli\n- Usage: `loopcli create <模板ID> --task \"任务描述\"`\n- Creates complete directory structure with AGENT marker, SOUL.md, PROMPT.md, memory/tasks.json, and state.json\n- Automatic registration and startup on next loopcli cycle\n\n## 5. **assign-task.md** - 派发任务\n- Purpose: Add new tasks to existing agents\n- Usage: `loopcli task <agent目录名> \"任务标题\" --desc \"任务描述\"`\n- Appends new tasks to tasks.json with auto-incrementing ID\n- Simple task assignment workflow\n\n## 6. **list-agents.md** - 列出 Agent\n- Purpose: View all registered agents and their status\n- Usage: `loopcli list`\n- Displays agent name, status, task count, and last run time\n- System overview capability\n\n## 7. **token-saving.md** - 节省 Token\n- Purpose: Conserve token usage with strict guidelines\n- Rules: Report results immediately when done, output IDLE when idle, keep output concise, exit when disabled\n- Cost control mechanism for the agent system\n\n## 8. **web-scraper.md** - Web Scraper\n- Purpose: Automated web data collection for market analysis, trend detection, and content generation\n- Three cost levels: simple HTML parsing (100-500 tokens), dynamic pages (500-2000 tokens), AI extraction (2000-5000 tokens)\n- Uses requests+BeautifulSoup, playwright-python, or scrapegraphai depending on complexity\n- Prohibits scraping paid content, privacy data, or causing IP blocks\n\n## 9. **content-generator.md** - Content Generator\n- Purpose: AI-driven content creation for monetizable digital assets\n- Focus areas: technical articles, tool templates, data analysis, course content\n- Quality standards: originality, practicality, completeness\n- Monetization channels: tech blogs, GitHub, paid courses, SaaS tools\n- Prohibits low-quality SEO content, plagiarism, or misleading tech advice\n\n## 10. **topic-tracker.md** - Topic Tracker\n- Purpose: Automatically track trending topics to provide data sources for content generation\n- Integrates with Hacker News API for free trending data\n- Automatic scoring based on popularity, comment count, keywords\n- Local caching to avoid duplicate requests\n- Zero cost implementation with potential for expansion to Reddit/GitHub\n\n## 11. **cost-optimizer.md** - 成本优化器 (Token Optimizer)\n- Purpose: Complete token usage visibility and cost control\n- Features: per-round token breakdown, cache analysis, cost tracking across 4 pricing tiers, quality scoring\n- Tracks sub-agent costs, skill adoption trends, and CLAUDE.md health\n- Based on alexgreensh/token-optimizer (465+ GitHub stars)\n- Provides dashboard at http://localhost:24842/token-optimizer\n- Handles both runtime and structural waste (75-85% of token usage)"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"328f9d51-5f9c-4f63-927e-7b99009d6517","uuid":"e1d52f4f-8fca-4f36-a4bb-64fdba84ea56","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:35:45.928Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read all 11 skill files under D:/loopcli/skill/ and pr